    {
      "id": "Xref",
      "code_hash": "e79a53bfa6afc3a46763d7ce8aec208c",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/html": "<div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: column;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><details>\n<summary style=\"cursor: pointer\"><code>TimetableModel(data)</code></summary>\n<marimo-ui-element object-id='Xref-0' random-id='32b07ac3-fc35-4a75-282a-f59509983827'><marimo-code-editor data-initial-value='&quot;def __init__(self, data):&#92;n    self.data = data&#92;n    self.model = model = cp_model.CpModel()&#92;n    self.blocks = []&#92;n    self.previous = None&#92;n    # R6: periods in which the teacher can&#x27;t teach&#92;n    unavailable = periods(data[&#x27;disponibilidade_excecoes&#x27;])&#92;n    # R7: how many rooms each pool has&#92;n    capacity = {pool: len(names) for pool, names in room_names(data).items()}&#92;n    # R5 and O1: teaching[professor, day, slot] lists the booleans of the blocks that may cover that period&#92;n    teaching = defaultdict(list)&#92;n    # R7: occupying[pool, day, slot], the same for each pool of rooms&#92;n    occupying = defaultdict(list)&#92;n    for grade in data[&#x27;turmas&#x27;]:&#92;n        times = []&#92;n        for subject in data[&#x27;disciplinas&#x27;]:&#92;n            length = 2 if subject[&#x27;duplo_periodo&#x27;] == &#x27;sim&#x27; else 1&#92;n            # R6: a block may only start where its teacher is available for all its periods&#92;n            starts = [(d, s) for d in range(5) for s in range(6 - length)&#92;n                      if all((subject[&#x27;professor&#x27;], d, s + k) not in unavailable&#92;n                             for k in range(length))]&#92;n            days = []&#92;n            for i in range(int(subject[&#x27;carga_semanal&#x27;]) // length):&#92;n                name = f&#x27;{grade[&#x27;turma&#x27;]}_{subject[&#x27;disciplina&#x27;]}_{i}&#x27;&#92;n                # R4: a double block starts early enough to end on the same day&#92;n                slot = model.new_int_var(0, 5 - length, f&#x27;slot_{name}&#x27;)&#92;n                day = model.new_int_var(0, 4, f&#x27;day_{name}&#x27;)&#92;n                model.add_allowed_assignments([day, slot], starts)&#92;n                days.append(day)&#92;n                times += [day * 5 + slot + k for k in range(length)]&#92;n                # one boolean per allowed start, true where the block is placed&#92;n                placements = {}&#92;n                for d, s in starts:&#92;n                    at = model.new_bool_var(f&#x27;{name}_at_{d}_{s}&#x27;)&#92;n                    model.add(day == d).only_enforce_if(at)&#92;n                    model.add(slot == s).only_enforce_if(at)&#92;n                    placements[d, s] = at&#92;n                    for k in range(length):&#92;n                        teaching[subject[&#x27;professor&#x27;], d, s + k].append(at)&#92;n                        occupying[room_pool(subject), d, s + k].append(at)&#92;n                model.add_exactly_one(placements.values())&#92;n                self.blocks.append(&#92;n                    Block(grade[&#x27;turma&#x27;], subject[&#x27;disciplina&#x27;], length, slot, day, placements)&#92;n                )&#92;n            # R3: increasing days, which also rules out symmetric solutions&#92;n            for earlier, later in zip(days, days[1:]):&#92;n                model.add(earlier &#92;u003c later)&#92;n        # https://claude.ai/code/session_01YEQ5gktWofWoRzXQcxMRHU&#92;n        # R1: no two lectures of the same grade at the same time&#92;n        model.add_all_different(times)&#92;n&#92;n    # R5: a teacher gives at most one lecture at a time&#92;n    for blocks in teaching.values():&#92;n        model.add_at_most_one(blocks)&#92;n    # R7: never more lectures in a pool of rooms than rooms in it&#92;n    for (pool, d, s), blocks in occupying.items():&#92;n        model.add(sum(blocks) &#92;u003c= capacity.get(pool, 0))&#92;n&#92;n    # O1: thanks to R5, a teacher teaches 0 or 1 lectures in each period&#92;n    busy = {key: sum(blocks) for key, blocks in teaching.items()}&#92;n    # O1: a free period with a lecture before and after it, on the same day, is a hole&#92;n    self.holes = []&#92;n    for teacher in dict.fromkeys(subject[&#x27;professor&#x27;] for subject in data[&#x27;disciplinas&#x27;]):&#92;n        for d in range(5):&#92;n            day_busy = [busy.get((teacher, d, p), 0) for p in range(5)]&#92;n            for p in range(1, 4):&#92;n                hole = model.new_bool_var(f&#x27;hole_{teacher}_{d}_{p}&#x27;)&#92;n                for q in range(p):&#92;n                    for r in range(p + 1, 5):&#92;n                        model.add(hole &#92;u003e= day_busy[q] + day_busy[r] - day_busy[p] - 1)&#92;n                self.holes.append(hole)&#92;n    # bonus: lectures in periods the teacher would rather not teach (preferencias.csv)&#92;n    self.unwanted = [busy[key] for key in periods(data.get(&#x27;preferencias&#x27;, [])) if key in busy]&#92;n&#92;ndef minimize_holes(self):&#92;n    self.model.minimize((len(self.unwanted) + 1) * sum(self.holes) + sum(self.unwanted))&#92;n&quot;' data-label='null' data-language='&quot;python&quot;' data-placeholder='&quot;&quot;' data-disabled='true' data-show-copy-button='true' data-debounce='false'></marimo-code-editor></marimo-ui-element>\n</details>\n\n<span class=\"paragraph\">A fun\u00e7\u00e3o inicia com o carregamento dos dados de \ud83d\udcc1 <code>from_folder</code>,\nem seguida os ficheiros s\u00e3o validados por <code>assert_data</code> e um modelo \u00e9\ninicializado.\nEnt\u00e3o, <b>constraints</b> s\u00e3o aplicados: <code>times</code>. <br />\nEstes constraints definem os slots e dias \"m\u00e1ximos\" que poder\u00e3o ser encontrados pelo solver.\nCada bloco s\u00f3 pode come\u00e7ar num tempo em que o professor est\u00e1 dispon\u00edvel durante todo o\nbloco (R6), um professor d\u00e1 no m\u00e1ximo uma aula de cada vez (R5) e, em cada tempo, nenhum\ntipo de sala tem mais aulas do que salas (R7). <br />\nO solver minimiza os buracos nos hor\u00e1rios dos professores (O1) e, se existir\n<code>preferencias.csv</code> (mesmo formato de <code>disponibilidade_excecoes.csv</code>),\nas aulas em tempos que o professor prefere evitar.\nUm buraco pesa mais do que todas essas aulas juntas, para que O1 tenha sempre prioridade. <br />\nCom os tempos decididos, um segundo modelo, mais pequeno, atribui a cada aula uma sala\nconcreta (ex.: Sala Normal 3), sem duas aulas na mesma sala ao mesmo tempo.</span></span><style>\n        .timetables {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 30rem), 1fr));\n            gap: 1.5rem;\n            margin-top: 1rem;\n            hyphens: auto;\n            overflow-wrap: break-word;\n        }\n        .timetables table {\n            width: 100%;\n            table-layout: fixed;\n            border-collapse: separate;\n            border-spacing: 3px;\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n        }\n        .timetables caption {\n            text-align: left;\n            font-size: 1rem;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            padding: 0 3px 0.25rem;\n        }\n        .timetables th {\n            font-weight: 500;\n            opacity: 0.6;\n            text-align: left;\n            padding: 0.25rem 0.5rem;\n        }\n        .timetables tr > th:first-child {\n            width: 2.25rem;\n            padding: 0;\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n        .timetables td {\n            height: 2.5rem;\n            padding: 0.25rem 0.5rem;\n            border-radius: 6px;\n            line-height: 1.2;\n            background: color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 4%, transparent);\n        }\n        .timetables td:not(:empty) {\n            font-weight: 500;\n            background: oklch(0.7 0.14 var(--hue) / 0.2);\n            box-shadow: inset 3px 0 oklch(0.65 0.15 var(--hue));\n        }\n        .timetables td.changed {\n            outline: 2px dashed oklch(0.6 0.15 var(--hue));\n            outline-offset: -2px;\n        }\n        .timetables small {\n            display: block;\n            font-weight: 400;\n            opacity: 0.7;\n        }\n    </style><div class=\"timetables\" lang=\"pt\"><table><caption>Turma 7\u00baA</caption><tr><th></th><th>Seg</th><th>Ter</th><th>Qua</th><th>Qui</th><th>Sex</th></tr><tr><th>1\u00ba</th><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td rowspan=\"1\" style=\"--hue: 120\">Ci\u00eancias<small>Laborat\u00f3rio</small></td></tr><tr><th>2\u00ba</th><td rowspan=\"1\" style=\"--hue: 180\">Hist\u00f3ria<small>Sala Normal 1</small></td><td></td><td></td><td rowspan=\"1\" style=\"--hue: 0\">Matem\u00e1tica<small>Sala Normal 1</small></td><td rowspan=\"1\" style=\"--hue: 0\">Matem\u00e1tica<small>Sala Normal 1</small></td></tr><tr><th>3\u00ba</th><td rowspan=\"1\" style=\"--hue: 240\">Ingl\u00eas<small>Sala Normal 1</small></td><td rowspan=\"1\" style=\"--hue: 0\">Matem\u00e1tica<small>Sala Normal 1</small></td><td rowspan=\"1\" style=\"--hue: 0\">Matem\u00e1tica<small>Sala Normal 1</small></td><td rowspan=\"1\" style=\"--hue: 60\">Portugu\u00eas<small>Sala Normal 1</small></td><td rowspan=\"1\" style=\"--hue: 60\">Portugu\u00eas<small>Sala Normal 1</small></td></tr><tr><th>4\u00ba</th><td></td><td rowspan=\"1\" style=\"--hue: 120\">Ci\u00eancias<small>Laborat\u00f3rio</small></td><td rowspan=\"1\" style=\"--hue: 60\">Portugu\u00eas<small>Sala Normal 1</small></td><td rowspan=\"1\" style=\"--hue: 180\">Hist\u00f3ria<small>Sala Normal 1</small></td><td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"--hue: 300\">Educa\u00e7\u00e3o F\u00edsica<small>Gin\u00e1sio</small></td></tr><tr><th>5\u00ba</th><td rowspan=\"1\" style=\"--hue: 120\">Ci\u00eancias<small>Laborat\u00f3rio</small></td><td rowspan=\"1\" style=\"--hue: 60\">Portugu\u00eas<small>Sala Normal 1</small></td><td></td><td rowspan=\"1\" style=\"--hue: 240\">Ingl\u00eas<small>Sala Normal 1</small></td></tr></table><table><caption>Turma 7\u00baB</caption><tr><th></th><th>Seg</th><th>Ter</th><th>Qua</th><th>Qui</th><th>Sex</th></tr><tr><th>1\u00ba</th><td rowspan=\"1\" style=\"--hue: 60\">Portugu\u00eas<small>Sala Normal 2</small></td><td></td><td rowspan=\"1\" style=\"--hue: 120\">Ci\u00eancias<small>Laborat\u00f3rio</small></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><th>2\u00ba</th><td rowspan=\"1\" style=\"--hue: 0\">Matem\u00e1tica<small>Sala Normal 2</small></td><td rowspan=\"1\" style=\"--hue: 0\">Matem\u00e1tica<small>Sala Normal 2</small></td><td rowspan=\"1\" style=\"--hue: 0\">Matem\u00e1tica<small>Sala Normal 2</small></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><th>3\u00ba</th><td></td><td rowspan=\"1\" style=\"--hue: 120\">Ci\u00eancias<small>Laborat\u00f3rio</small></td><td rowspan=\"1\" style=\"--hue: 60\">Portugu\u00eas<small>Sala Normal 2</small></td><td></td><td rowspan=\"1\" style=\"--hue: 0\">Matem\u00e1tica<small>Sala Normal 2</small></td></tr><tr><th>4\u00ba</th><td rowspan=\"1\" style=\"--hue: 180\">Hist\u00f3ria<small>Sala Normal 2</small></td><td rowspan=\"1\" style=\"--hue: 60\">Portugu\u00eas<small>Sala Normal 2</small></td><td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"--hue: 300\">Educa\u00e7\u00e3o F\u00edsica<small>Gin\u00e1sio</small></td><td rowspan=\"1\" style=\"--hue: 60\">Portugu\u00eas<small>Sala Normal 2</small></td><td rowspan=\"1\" style=\"--hue: 180\">Hist\u00f3ria<small>Sala Normal 2</small></td></tr><tr><th>5\u00ba</th><td rowspan=\"1\" style=\"--hue: 240\">Ingl\u00eas<small>Sala Normal 2</small></td><td></td><td rowspan=\"1\" style=\"--hue: 120\">Ci\u00eancias<small>Laborat\u00f3rio</small></td><td rowspan=\"1\" style=\"--hue: 240\">Ingl\u00eas<small>Sala Normal 2</small></td></tr></table></div><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>0</strong> buracos nos hor\u00e1rios dos professores e <strong>0</strong> aulas em tempos que o professor prefere evitar: solu\u00e7\u00e3o \u00f3tima, encontrada em 0.10 s.</span></span></div>"
          }
        }
